ows the opponent to realize their equity for free, potentially hitting a flush or two pair on the turn. Betting extracts value from worse hands (like a Jack or a worse Queen) and charges the opponent to chase their draws. A bet of around half the estimated pot size strikes a good balance between value and protection.\n\nAnswer: 200"}
